		"name": "RAG_Chatbot",
		"description": "StartFragmentThis project is a **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot** built using **Django REST Framework**.  \nUsers can register, log in, ask questions, and retrieve their chat history. The chatbot retrieves relevant information from PDF documents using **semantic search**, embeds them in **Pinecone**, and generates responses using the **Groq API (OpenAI-120B)**.EndFragment",
